Assistant: I see the issue now. The TimezoneSelect component requires a `value` prop and proper timezone data. Let's fix the preview component by adding the required props and proper initialization.

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/TimezoneSelectComponent-bf133f2d.tsx">
